{"unit_id": "liujuntao123__dsh-clinepass-pin#feature-1", "repo": "liujuntao123/dsh-clinepass-pin", "commit": "6ec5569325645e6cab20fd09a77a0bd99b45aa81", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-clinepass-pin 的功能「固定模型上游」：为匹配的聊天请求添加 providerOptions.gateway.only，将配置模型限制到指定上游；默认针对 DeepSeek dated 快照并选择 deepseek。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:96-105", "cordis.patch.yml:17-22"]}
{"unit_id": "liujuntao123__dsh-clinepass-pin#feature-2", "repo": "liujuntao123/dsh-clinepass-pin", "commit": "6ec5569325645e6cab20fd09a77a0bd99b45aa81", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-clinepass-pin 的功能「按请求条件改写」：仅处理指定网关地址的聊天完成请求和配置模型的 JSON 字符串请求体；其他地址、模型或不符合形状的请求原样透传。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:76-85", "index.js:187-219"]}
{"unit_id": "liujuntao123__dsh-clinepass-pin#feature-3", "repo": "liujuntao123/dsh-clinepass-pin", "commit": "6ec5569325645e6cab20fd09a77a0bd99b45aa81", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-clinepass-pin 的功能「保留已有路由限制」：若请求已含非空 gateway.only 就不再覆盖，同时合并写入字段并保留既有 gateway.order。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:96-105"]}
{"unit_id": "liujuntao123__dsh-clinepass-pin#feature-4", "repo": "liujuntao123/dsh-clinepass-pin", "commit": "6ec5569325645e6cab20fd09a77a0bd99b45aa81", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-clinepass-pin 的功能「状态记录与卸载」：安装 fetch 包装后统计固定、跳过和错误次数，并定时写状态文件；插件卸载时在包装仍生效的情况下恢复原 fetch。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:140-175", "index.js:221-240"]}
{"unit_id": "liujuntao123__dsh-clinepass-pin#caveat-1", "repo": "liujuntao123/dsh-clinepass-pin", "commit": "6ec5569325645e6cab20fd09a77a0bd99b45aa81", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-clinepass-pin 会将匹配的聊天请求体发送到默认外部网关 api.cline.bot，并写入本地状态文件；硬性上游限制不提供备用路由，配置的上游不可用时请求可能失败。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:48", "index.js:154-169", "cordis.patch.yml:13-22"]}
